<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1501477661"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1542919816"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="カンナギ (feat. Hanon &amp; Kotoha)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="HoneyWorks / Kotoha / Hanon"/><amll:meta key="album" value="水声少女 (feat. Hanon &amp; Kotoha)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:34.328"><div begin="00:12.251" end="03:34.328"><p begin="00:12.251" end="00:13.220" itunes:key="L1">「どうして？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“为什么？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 do u shi te ？」</span></p><p begin="00:13.221" end="00:15.243" itunes:key="L2">少女は泣いている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">少女在哭泣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u jo ha na i te i ru</span></p><p begin="00:15.244" end="00:16.151" itunes:key="L3">「どうして？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“为什么？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 do u shi te ？」</span></p><p begin="00:16.152" end="00:18.336" itunes:key="L4">日の巫女として歌う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在作为太阳巫女歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi no mi ko to shi te u ta u</span></p><p begin="00:18.337" end="00:21.440" itunes:key="L5">錆びた神楽鈴とほつれ擦れた袴<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">手握生锈的神乐铃 身上穿的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa bi ta ka gu ra su zu to ho tsu re su re ta ha ka ma</span></p><p begin="00:21.441" end="00:23.133" itunes:key="L6">身にまとって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是开线破损的衣服</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ni ma to 't te</span></p><p begin="00:24.219" end="00:24.963" itunes:key="L7">さよなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra</span></p><p begin="00:24.964" end="00:27.068" itunes:key="L8">向こうでまた笑わせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请在对面再次为我微笑吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ko u de ma ta wa ra wa se te</span></p><p begin="00:27.069" end="00:27.906" itunes:key="L9">さよなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra</span></p><p begin="00:27.907" end="00:30.265" itunes:key="L10">浮世でまだ笑わせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这浮世为我微笑吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ki yo de ma da wa ra wa se te</span></p><p begin="00:30.266" end="00:33.304" itunes:key="L11">幸の舞を踊り 幸の福を祈れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跳起幸福之舞 为幸福祈祷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko u no ma i wo o do ri ko u no fu ku wo i no re</span></p><p begin="00:33.305" end="00:35.350" itunes:key="L12">宿れるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿福降临</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya do re ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:39.321" end="00:41.882" itunes:key="L13">うらら うらら 麗らかであれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光光 天晴朗 明媚起来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ra ra u ra ra u ra ra ka de a re</span></p><p begin="00:41.883" end="00:45.101" itunes:key="L14">ポカポカ のどか 空も晴れ晴れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暖融融风和煦 天空万里无云</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po ka po ka no do ka so ra mo ha re ba re</span></p><p begin="00:45.102" end="00:47.785" itunes:key="L15">物見櫓で回せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">景色在高台四周旋转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo no mi ya gu ra de ma wa se</span></p><p begin="00:47.786" end="00:50.852" itunes:key="L16">TWO THOUSAND PEACE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">TWO THOUSAND PEACE</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Two thousand peace</span></p><p begin="00:53.654" end="00:57.196" itunes:key="L17">はっ はっ</p><p begin="01:02.756" end="01:05.990" itunes:key="L18">(HI) 愛されていたあなたへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">致被爱的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( Hi) a i sa re te i ta a na ta he</span></p><p begin="01:05.991" end="01:08.997" itunes:key="L19">(HI) 愛されていくあなたへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">致将继续被爱的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( Hi) a i sa re te i ku a na ta he</span></p><p begin="01:08.998" end="01:11.504" itunes:key="L20">巫の声が響くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巫女的声音回荡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n na gi no ko e ga hi bi ku yo</span></p><p begin="01:11.505" end="01:19.732" itunes:key="L21">憂世に奏でる歌<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于浮世奏响祷歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ki yo ni ka na de ru u ta</span></p><p begin="01:26.828" end="01:29.636" itunes:key="L22">豊作・繁華・セレモニー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">丰收 繁华 庆典</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho u sa ku ha n ka se re mo ni i</span></p><p begin="01:29.637" end="01:32.715" itunes:key="L23">歓喜の民は踊る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">欢喜的民众跳起舞来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n ki no ta mi ha o do ru</span></p><p begin="01:32.716" end="01:34.087" itunes:key="L24">神を奉りたまえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">供奉神明吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka mi wo ma tsu ri ta ma e</span></p><p begin="01:34.088" end="01:35.708" itunes:key="L25">神を崇めたまえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">崇敬神明吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka mi wo a ga me ta ma e</span></p><p begin="01:35.709" end="01:41.667" itunes:key="L26">「KA・WA・IIかも？」御神楽に酔う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“或许还挺可爱的？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 KA WA II ka mo ？」</span></p><p begin="01:41.675" end="01:44.065" itunes:key="L27">うらら うらら 麗らかであれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光光 天晴朗 明媚起来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ra ra u ra ra u ra ra ka de a re</span></p><p begin="01:44.066" end="01:47.371" itunes:key="L28">ポカポカ のどか 空も晴れ晴れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暖融融风和煦 天空万里无云</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po ka po ka no do ka so ra mo ha re ba re</span></p><p begin="01:47.372" end="01:50.086" itunes:key="L29">物見櫓で唄え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">环顾四周在高台上歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo no mi ya gu ra de u ta e</span></p><p begin="01:50.087" end="01:52.746" itunes:key="L30">TWO THOUSAND PEACE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">TWO THOUSAND PEACE</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Two thousand peace</span></p><p begin="01:55.968" end="01:59.156" itunes:key="L31">はっ はっ</p><p begin="02:05.392" end="02:08.079" itunes:key="L32">(HI)強く生きた英雄が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿坚强生存的英雄</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( Hi) tsu yo ku i ki ta e i yu u ga</span></p><p begin="02:08.080" end="02:11.099" itunes:key="L33">(HI)安らかに眠れるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以安稳入睡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( Hi) ya su ra ka ni ne mu re ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:11.100" end="02:13.614" itunes:key="L34">巫の鏡は照らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">女巫的镜子照耀出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n na gi no ka ga mi ha te ra su</span></p><p begin="02:13.615" end="02:21.927" itunes:key="L35">浮世に繋ぐ光<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连通浮世的光芒 ah</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ki yo ni tsu na gu hi ka ri ah</span></p><p begin="02:28.931" end="02:31.647" itunes:key="L36">うらら うらら 麗らかであれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光光 天晴朗 明媚起来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ra ra u ra ra u ra ra ka de a re</span></p><p begin="02:31.648" end="02:34.837" itunes:key="L37">ポカポカ のどか 空も晴れ晴れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暖融融风和煦 天空万里无云</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po ka po ka no do ka so ra mo ha re ba re</span></p><p begin="02:34.838" end="02:37.484" itunes:key="L38">物見櫓で回せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">景色在高台四周旋转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo no mi ya gu ra de ma wa se</span></p><p begin="02:37.485" end="02:40.270" itunes:key="L39">TWO THOUSAND PEACE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">TWO THOUSAND PEACE</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Two thousand peace</span></p><p begin="02:43.309" end="02:46.839" itunes:key="L40">はっ はっ</p><p begin="02:52.213" end="02:55.189" itunes:key="L41">うらら パッと晴れの日も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天光光 蓦然放晴的日子也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ra ra pa 't to ha re no hi mo</span></p><p begin="02:55.190" end="02:58.509" itunes:key="L42">うるる 泣いて濡れる日も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪漓漓 哭个不停的日子也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ru ru na i te nu re ru hi mo</span></p><p begin="02:58.510" end="03:01.046" itunes:key="L43">物見櫓で回せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">景色在高台四周旋转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo no mi ya gu ra de ma wa se</span></p><p begin="03:01.047" end="03:04.097" itunes:key="L44">TWO THOUSAND PEACE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">TWO THOUSAND PEACE</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Two thousand peace</span></p><p begin="03:04.469" end="03:07.437" itunes:key="L45">(HI) 愛されていたあなたへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">致被爱的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( Hi) a i sa re te i ta a na ta he</span></p><p begin="03:07.438" end="03:10.267" itunes:key="L46">(HI) 愛されていくあなたへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">致将继续被爱的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( Hi) a i sa re te i ku a na ta he</span></p><p begin="03:10.268" end="03:12.953" itunes:key="L47">巫の声が響くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巫女的声音回荡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n na gi no ko e ga hi bi ku yo</span></p><p begin="03:12.954" end="03:34.328" itunes:key="L48">憂世に奏でる歌<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于浮世奏响祷歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ki yo ni ka na de ru u ta</span></p></div></body></tt>